        "id": 11434
      },
      "writtenOn": "2016-05-23T20:52:05Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is to allow running Keystone without any downtime.\nallow_plaintext should only be enabled when first starting keystone.  Once the credentials are migrated then allow_plaintext should be set to false in order to catch any errors due to encryption.\n\nI can remove this flag if we are fine with keystone downtime.",
